    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc02_0250_select_03",
      "hash64": "B826D9645B7654AA",
      "text": "更深的地方是哪里？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc02_0250_select_04",
      "hash64": "B826D4645B764C2B",
      "text": "比零区研究所更深？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc02_0250_bbteacher_06",
      "hash64": "703B888FDD7C1BCB",
      "text": "根据海哲的手记，他曾经\\n从最深处掉到了更下面的地方。[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc02_0250_sister_04",
      "hash64": "7EFDE2C60D8009A3",
      "text": "哦～？原来最深处\\n不是最下面的意思啊？[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc02_0250_bbteacher_07",
      "hash64": "703B878FDD7C1A18",
      "text": "真是不可思议啊！[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc02_0250_bbteacher_08",
      "hash64": "703B868FDD7C1865",
      "text": "不过，去那里的路也好，方法也好，\\n他在手记里提到自己完全不记得了。[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc02_0250_bbteacher_09",
      "hash64": "703B858FDD7C16B2",
      "text": "如果相信海哲的话，\\n那第零区更下面的地方\\r\\n应该还有不为人知的空间……[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc02_0250_bbteacher_10",
      "hash64": "7038888FDD79E5F4",
      "text": "总之我们赶快去最深处……\\n那个叫零区研究所的地方吧。\\r\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，就拜托你带路了哦。[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
